Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 23:51:48 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1165/1177] HERESY 1167: the Trainer: no twin of the last
 epoch, the Runs column the window's height, the log at the page's foot
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor, the night of 05.10.2026:
· «У Тренера последний чекпоинт дублируется в списке. В каждой сессии»: the run's final file (no step in its name) is the
  last epoch's twin; it is listed only when no numbered checkpoint has its step (lab/training.py).
· «Колонку Runs вытяни по всей высоте страницы»: the column as tall as the window, however few runs.
· «The log открывает новую вкладку. Вынеси это вниз в подвальный фрейм»: the log in a panel at the page's foot, its tail
  following a live run every 3 s while open; ✕ or Esc closes it; Download keeps the whole file a click away.

cdp-console 334/0/7, check-i18n 14/0, check-player 3/0.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 tools/console/app.css         | 11 ++++++++++
 tools/console/heresy-train.js | 41 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 2 files changed, 50 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tools/console/app.css b/tools/console/app.css
index b542636..8c917c9 100644
--- a/tools/console/app.css
+++ b/tools/console/app.css
@@ -3987,3 +3987,14 @@ select option, select optgroup { background-color: var(--panel); color: var(--in
 .lib-toggle.lib-rate-f { display: inline-grid; place-items: center; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; }
 .lib-toggle.lib-rate-f svg { width: 15px; height: 15px; fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 2; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
 .lib-toggle.lib-rate-f[aria-pressed="true"] svg { fill: currentColor; fill-opacity: .25; }
+/* HERESY 1167 (Viktor: «Колонку Runs вытяни по всей высоте страницы»): as tall as the window, however few runs */
+.tr-side { height: calc(100vh - var(--bar-h) - var(--playbar-h, 60px) - 80px); }
+/* the run's log at the page's foot (Viktor: «Вынеси это вниз в подвальный фрейм») */
+.tr-logdock { position: fixed; left: 16px; right: 16px; bottom: calc(var(--playbar-h, 60px) + 10px); z-index: 36; height: min(38vh, 380px);
+  display: flex; flex-direction: column; border: 1px solid var(--line-strong-a, var(--line-a)); border-radius: var(--r-md); background: var(--panel);
+  box-shadow: 0 -12px 40px -16px var(--shadow-lg); }
+.tr-logdock[hidden] { display: none; }
+.tr-logdock-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 8px 10px 6px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-a); }
+.tr-logdock-head .spacer { flex: 1; }
+.tr-logdock-name { font-size: 12px; }
+.tr-logdock-body { flex: 1; margin: 0; padding: 8px 14px 10px; overflow: auto; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.45; white-space: pre; color: var(--muted); }
